  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transfer project Mocambique 2014-2017</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Transfer project Mocambique 2014-2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett initiativ kring forskning och l&#xe4;rande om sociala                  kontant&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ringar (bidrag) i Afrika. Lett av UNICEF, tillsammans    med Save the Children UK, FAO-Rome och University of North  Carolina. Huvudsyfte att samla evidens kring effektiveteten av sociala          kontant&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ringar f&#xf6;r familjer och barn som lever i fattigdom.      Finansierat av medel hemdelegerade fr UGA RWA TZA MOZ KEN.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-country research and learning initiative intended to further    knowledge about impacts of social cash transfers in Africa. Led by    UNICEF Office of Research in partnership with Save the Children-UK,   FAO-Rome and the University of North Carolina. Aim: provide evidence  on effectiveness of social cash transfers in achieving impacts for    poor families and children. Funds reallocated fr UGA RWA TZA MOZ KEN</narrative>
  </description>
